What is the output of the following Java program featuring state tracking logic in a JavaBean mutator?
```java
import java.io.Serializable;
public class ToggleSwitchBean implements Serializable {
    private boolean on = false;
    private int toggleCount = 0;
    public ToggleSwitchBean() {}
    public boolean isOn() { return on; }
    public void setOn(boolean on) {
        if (this.on != on) {
            this.on = on;
            this.toggleCount++;
        }
    }
    public int getToggleCount() { return toggleCount; }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        ToggleSwitchBean b = new ToggleSwitchBean();
        b.setOn(true);
        b.setOn(true);
        b.setOn(false);
        System.out.println(b.getToggleCount());
    }
}
```
